## Änderungen Datei für Datei:

### 1. js/modules/stats-table.js (Game Center)

In `attachValueClickHandlers()` - der Touch-Handler muss ZUERST prüfen ob Handler attached sind UND den State korrekt handhaben:

```javascript
attachValueClickHandlers() {
  this.container.querySelectorAll("td[data-player][data-cat]").forEach(td => {
    // KRITISCH: Prüfe ob Handler bereits attached sind
    if (td.dataset.handlersAttached === 'true') {
      return;
    }
    td.dataset.handlersAttached = 'true';

    // State AUF DEM ELEMENT speichern - NICHT in Closure
    if (!td._tapState) {
      td._tapState = {
        lastTapTime: 0,
        tapTimeout: null
      };
    }
    const state = td._tapState;

    // MOBILE: Touch-Handler mit preventDefault/stopPropagation
    td.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      e.stopPropagation();

      if (this.dragState.isDragging) return;

      const now = Date.now();

      // Double-Tap Detection
      if (state.lastTapTime > 0 && (now - state.lastTapTime < 300)) {
        if (state.tapTimeout) {
          clearTimeout(state.tapTimeout);
          state.tapTimeout = null;
        }
        state.lastTapTime = 0;
        this.changeValue(td, -1);  // MINUS
        return;
      }

      state.lastTapTime = now;
      state.tapTimeout = setTimeout(() => {
        this.changeValue(td, 1);  // PLUS
        state.tapTimeout = null;
        state.lastTapTime = 0;
      }, 300);
    }, { passive: false });

    // DESKTOP: click für +1
    td.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
      if (this.dragState.isDragging) return;
      // Ignoriere wenn Touch-Handler gerade aktiv war
      if (state.lastTapTime > 0 && Date.now() - state.lastTapTime < 500) return;

      if (state.tapTimeout) clearTimeout(state.tapTimeout);
      state.tapTimeout = setTimeout(() => {
        this.changeValue(td, 1);
        state.tapTimeout = null;
      }, 200);
    });

    // DESKTOP: dblclick für -1
    td.addEventListener("dblclick", (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      if (this.dragState.isDragging) return;

      if (state.tapTimeout) {
        clearTimeout(state.tapTimeout);
        state.tapTimeout = null;
      }
      this.changeValue(td, -1);
    });
  });
}
```

Gleiche Logik für `attachTimeClickHandlers()` - Single-Tap +10s, Double-Tap -10s.

---

### 2. js/modules/season-table.js

Gleiche Touch-Tap-Logik für alle klickbaren Zellen:
- `e.preventDefault()` und `e.stopPropagation()`
- `{ passive: false }`
- State auf Element speichern (`cell._tapState`)
- Single-Tap +1, Double-Tap (<300ms) -1

---

### 3. js/modules/goal-value.js

Für alle Data-Zellen (Player × Opponent):
- Touch-Handler wie oben
- Single-Tap +1, Double-Tap -1
- `e.preventDefault()`/`stopPropagation()`
- `{ passive: false }`

---

